mpass Runtime Agent, which was previously installed with Kyma runtime. From now on\",288\n25,\"--- Record 1891 ---\nComponent: SAP Task Center\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: New Properties to Optimize Search Performance\nDescription: Two new properties tc.pp.user_types and tc.pp.search_operation can be set up to optimize the performance of the people search engine for very large user groups.  For more information, see Identity Directory Connectivity.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-11-19\nValid as Of: 2024-11-19\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1892 ---\nComponent: Kyma Runtime\nEnvironment: Kyma\nTitle: Istio module: Deletion of the annotation disable-external-name-alias\nDescription: The annotation disable-external-name-alias is scheduled to be deleted on 04.11 in the fast channel and on 18.11 in the regular channel. See the deprecation note.Required action: If you are using the annotation, follow themigration guide and adjust your resources’ configuration to align with Istio’s behavior.\nAction: Required\nLifecycle: Deleted\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-09-13\nValid as Of: 2024-11-18\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1893 ---\nComponent: Graph\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Business Data Graph Editor\nDescription: You can edit your business data graph directly in Graph on Integration Suite.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Intelligent Technologies\nLatest Revision: 2024-11-18\nValid as Of: 2024-11-18\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1894 ---\nComponent: Kyma Runtime\nEnvironment: Kyma\nTitle: Application Connector module: Documentation\nDescription: We're excited to announce that the Application Connector module documentation is now live on Help Portal. To learn more about connecting your workflows deployed on Kyma with external solutions, see Application Connector Module.\nAction: Info only\nLi